# CLion's build directories. Deliberately not the bare "cmake*": git matches
# ignore patterns case-insensitively on Windows and macOS, so that pattern also
# swallowed CMakeLists.txt — a new one in a subdirectory was silently untracked
# and the build only broke on CI, where the file did not exist.
cmake-build-*/
# Local SignPath setup notes / artifact configs (do not commit)
/signpath-setup/
